==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 10.67~21.33 seconds<sup>320f~640f</sup>.
**20 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 5.33~10.67 seconds<sup>160f~320f</sup>.
**20 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 2.67~5.33 seconds<sup>80f~160f</sup>.
**5 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
**5 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Assuming you already brought zombie units as this is a continuation stage- [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong cat]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife cat]], and other general zombie attackers will be enough to deal with any of these enemies

